# Seed packs: only the public profiles may ever reach a Docker build context.
# A private profile (e.g. seeds/private-ray/) is gitignored and CI checkouts
# never have it, but a LOCAL `docker build` run from a working tree that
# happens to have one sitting there must not bake it into the image —
# explicit allowlist rather than trusting the working tree to be clean.
seeds/*
!seeds/example/
!seeds/example/**
!seeds/empty/
!seeds/empty/**
!seeds/README.md
